# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# PONDER INDEXER ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the values

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# DATABASE (optional for development, REQUIRED for staging/production)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# LEAVE DATABASE_URL UNSET FOR LOCAL DEVELOPMENT. ponder.config.ts declares no
# database, so with no DATABASE_URL Ponder runs on PGlite — an embedded Postgres
# stored in apps/indexer/.ponder. No server to install, and `pnpm indexer:wipe`
# (rm -rf .ponder) is the reset.
#
# Set it only to run dev against a real Postgres, or when deploying staging or
# production. Quick start with Docker:
#   docker run --name ponder-postgres -e POSTGRES_PASSWORD=password -p 5432:5432 -d postgres
#
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:password@localhost:5432/postgres

# Schema name. The run scripts pin the schema on the command line:
#   pnpm dev   -> ponder dev   --schema swr_dev
#   ponder start (via gateway) -> ponder start --schema swr_prod
# so this variable only matters for tooling that reads it directly (e.g. db:wipe).
DATABASE_SCHEMA=swr_indexer

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# ENVIRONMENT SELECTION
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Options: development | staging | production
# - development: Uses Anvil local chains (31337/31338)
# - staging: Uses Base Sepolia testnet
# - production: Uses Base mainnet
PONDER_ENV=development

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# RPC URLs BY CHAIN ID
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Only configure the RPC for your target environment

# Development (Anvil) - default localhost
PONDER_RPC_URL_31337=http://127.0.0.1:8545

# Staging (Base Sepolia) - requires Alchemy/Infura key
# PONDER_RPC_URL_84532=https://base-sepolia.g.alchemy.com/v2/YOUR_KEY

# Production (Base Mainnet) - requires Alchemy/Infura key
# PONDER_RPC_URL_8453=https://base-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/YOUR_KEY

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# START BLOCKS (REQUIRED for staging/production — ponder.config.ts THROWS
# without them, since syncing from block 0 would be extremely slow and costly)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Set to the contract deployment block on that chain. Development starts at 0.
# PONDER_START_BLOCK_84532=
# PONDER_START_BLOCK_8453=
